%% The brew job lifecycle, rendered to lifecycle.svg. To regenerate:
%%   npx -p @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli@11.17.0 mmdc -i lifecycle.mmd -o lifecycle.svg -c mermaid.json -b white
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    Listed: Listed<br/>(shown in brewJobs)
    Taken: Taken<br/>(hidden from brewJobs)
    Dropped: Dropped
    Adjusted: Done, grinder adjusts
    Skipped: Done, grinder skips it

    [*] --> Listed: person grinds with a GbS recipe
    Listed --> Taken: brewAccept
    Listed --> Dropped: not taken for ~60 s
    Taken --> Listed: no brewDone for ~50 s
    Taken --> Adjusted: brewDone Success
    Taken --> Skipped: brewDone Canceled
    Dropped --> [*]
    Adjusted --> [*]
    Skipped --> [*]

